    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "9e3f5dbf95f72f49",
    "source": "&584 Nah. I don't want it now that I know what's in it.",
    "target": "&584 不了。知道里面是什么以后，我不想要了。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "aef5f3b7dfcd9b6c",
    "source": "&13 Hey! Hands off my coffee!",
    "target": "&13 嘿，别碰我的咖啡！",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "13ee024967a65080",
    "source": "&14 Hey! Beat it, thrall.",
    "target": "&14 嘿，滚开，迷奴。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "8f1f9426de027b75",
    "source": "&586 I don't need to hack it - he didn't log out.",
    "target": "&586 不用入侵，他没退出登录。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "b7f0af408a68dbdd",
    "source": "//ERROR: INPUT DRIVERS DISABLED[[//Abort, Retry or Fail?",
    "target": "//错误：输入驱动已禁用[[//中止、重试，还是失败？",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "2f258ba531daf11f",
    "source": "&586 This screen shows the weight on the measuring platform in front of it. Apparently, it's holding 51kg at the moment.",
    "target": "&586 这块屏幕显示前面称重平台上的重量。目前似乎是51公斤。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "3343ffcd3a41b264",
    "source": "&587 This screen shows the weight on the measuring platform in front of it. Apparently, it's holding 96kg at the moment.",
    "target": "&587 这块屏幕显示前面称重平台上的重量。目前似乎是96公斤。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "8f6de4d564dd9c55",
    "source": "&587 It's just a readout showing how much weight is on this platform.",
    "target": "&587 只是个读数屏，显示平台上放了多重的东西。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "2f1ff73544ea63da",
    "source": "&588 // Cargo Status:[- Loading COMPLETE[- Checks  COMPLETE[[#XANADU ER-2 Make ready to launch",
    "target": "&588 //货物状态：[- 装载完成[- 检查完成[[#XANADU ER-2 准备起飞",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "5bb6de49366b8bd7",
    "source": "&1677 I got here just in time, they're about ready to run!",
    "target": "&1677 来得正好，他们马上就要走了！",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "60a1fbbc313c1d70",
    "source": "&589 In the kind of feeling knowable only to those with a head full of wiring, you can sense the signal radiating out from the airship. The guards posted around it would probably do their best to stop you getting any closer, though.",
    "target": "&589 只有脑中装满神经接口的人，才会体会这种感觉：你能感知到从飞艇中散发的信号。不过，周围的守卫肯定会竭力阻止你靠近。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "72e7f318076fb9be",
    "source": "&590 An old wreck of an aerostat sits on the dockyard. While the lack of guards on the airfield is good news in an immediate sense, it suggests to you that the airship's interior is just going to be better patrolled.",
    "target": "&590 码头上停着一艘破旧的浮空艇。起降场没有守卫，眼下算好消息，却也意味着，飞艇内部的巡逻很可能更加严密。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "50a8ba8ed3480feb",
    "source": "&591 Try as you might, you can't find any systems on it that appear new enough to accept a wetware bond. That'd make their security system at least...hm...twenty years old, you reckon.",
    "target": "&591 不管怎么试，都找不到足够新、能与湿件连接的系统。你估计，这套安保系统至少……嗯……二十年了。",
    "status": "reviewed",
    "reason": "",
    "review_notes": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "c8862405247846ee",
    "source": "&592 Though the aircon succumbed to your strength, it doesn't look like you can overcome this door with it - the number of magnetic sensors around it suggest that an attempt to pry it open would be met with several alarms.",
    "target": "&592 空调虽然被你弄坏，可这扇门似乎没法照办。周围有许多磁性传感器，说明试图撬门，可能引发好几处警报。",
    "status": "reviewed",
